### 3. `/home/admin/frontend/src/lib/classSessionsApi.js` (full)

Small lib module: **`normalizeClassSessionsPayload`** maps Laravel/PascalCase fields to camelCase, groups by `student_class_id`, sorts; **`fetchClassSessions`** builds `URLSearchParams`, `fetch('/api/v1/class-sessions?...')` with `Accept: application/json` and optional `Authorization: Bearer ${token}`, throws on `!res.ok`, returns normalized payload.

