**Quick checklist for chat / bug-report UI:** add a page component under `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/`, import it in `App.vue`, extend `sidebarNavGroups` (and optionally `mobileTabItems`), add a `v-if="... && active === 'your-page'"` with `:branch-id="currentBranch"` if needed, reuse `page-header` + `card` + branch null-check like `NotificationsCenter.vue`, and call APIs with `fetch` + Bearer token like `classSessionsApi.js` or via `supabase.from(...)`.

